{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Your right hand, YHWH, etc.</b> Meaning: when the attribute of mercy grows strong to perform an act of judgment — and this is what is meant by <b>is glorious in power</b> — then Your right hand, YHWH, which is the attribute of mercy itself, will shatter the enemy. Or it may be expounded from its end to its beginning: When is <b>Your right hand, YHWH, glorious in power</b>? When Your right hand, YHWH, shatters the enemy — then awe and dread will fall upon all created beings because of Your awesome Name."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:28:17.812867881Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}